{title: Here Is Love (Grace Takes My Sin)}
{author: Kate Simmonds, William Rees}
{key: D}
{tempo: 60}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Verse 1}
Here is [D]love vast as the [G]ocean
Loving [D]kindness as the [A]flood
When the [D]Prince of life our [G]ransom
Shed for [D]us His [A]precious [D]blood
Who His [D/F#]love will not rem[A]ember
